cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "KSHV_math: mathematical analysis of KSHV replication and segregation"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gastonguay
    given-names: Madeleine
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5700-8543"
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MadeleineGastonguay/KSHV_math"
abstract: >-
  Code to reproduce the analysis and simulations in Juillard et al. (2026),
  estimating the replication and segregation efficiency of KSHV episomes from
  fluorescence microscopy images of latently infected cells and simulating long-term episome dynamics.
keywords:
  - KSHV
  - episome maintenance
  - extrachromosomal DNA
  - LANA
  - stochastic simulation
  - math modeling
